5</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">lawfully</b>, <span class=\"gk\">τοῖς γ. συμβιώσασιν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phld.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Piet.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">93</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"gk\">γνήσια, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τά</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">charges on land</b>, <span class=\"gk\">γ. δημόσια</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PAmh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">86.15</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(i A. D.)</span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PLond.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.1157.4</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div></div>"}